RustAuth is a Windows desktop authenticator, written in Rust.

This project is a ground-up rewrite in Rust of WinAuth:
    https://github.com/winauth/winauth
    Copyright (C) 2011 Colin Mackie and WinAuth contributors
    Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later

Portions of this software — authenticator algorithm behavior, legacy
data-format handling and migration logic — are derived from that
GPL-3.0-or-later work.

